{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">伯恩斯坦：某饮料公司上半年营收增16%，即饮茶利润占比过半</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">该公司交出了一份营收和利润都略<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>的半年报，但真正改变公司利润结构的，不是包装水，而是即饮茶。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>在最新研报中给出的判断很直接：即饮茶业务已经贡献了公司超过一半的利润，而包装水业务正受到PET成本上升和去年同期高基数的双重影响。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。上半年该公司营收同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，EBIT同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>，分别比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>和比市场一致预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>。这个“<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>”主要来自即饮茶，该业务EBIT同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31%</span>，比Bernstein预期高出12%。包装水则相对平稳，营收仅增长2%，EBIT同比小幅调整3%，利润率调整167个基点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这两块业务拆开看，公司的利润重心已经完成切换。即饮茶EBIT达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">64.06亿元</span>，占整体EBIT的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">52%</span>；包装水EBIT为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">32.57亿元</span>，占比约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>。一年前，这两个数字还接近对半开。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>在图表中专门标出这一点：即饮茶在营收中的占比持续上升，在利润中的占比已经过半。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXzSpSib357SPVAM74Zr7tHETItv29Fm91zYn54VOOh2IgVBVEd0sQu4lfprNibAWBC3p0h83XYrUuN8mlsCzCJiaaWm961Y6Ro14/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 即饮茶靠新品和配方调整维持<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>增长</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">上半年即饮茶营收同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30.1%</span>，达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">131.22亿元</span>，比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.1%</span>，比市场一致预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>。该公司把增长归因于东方树叶新口味上市、差异化包装规格，以及茶π含糖量降低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>等健康化配方升级。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">茶π减糖这个细节值得留意。它说明即饮茶的增长不只是渠道铺货的结果，产品配方调整本身就在拉动需求。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>认为，无糖茶的健康化趋势仍在延续，而该公司通过产品迭代把这一趋势转化为实际营收。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">茶饮利润率也在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，EBIT利润率同比扩大46个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.8%</span>。这个幅度略低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>预期，原因是PET成本上升比预想来得更早。但即便如此，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.8%</span>的利润率仍然显著高于市场一致预期所反映的水平——市场原本预期茶饮利润率会调整80个基点。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看茶饮利润率这个数字，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.8%</span>的EBIT利润率在食品饮料行业里属于很高的水平。简单说，茶饮业务现在既贡献了过半利润，又保持了高增长，这决定了公司整体利润率的走向。更值得观察的是，PET成本不确定性如果持续，茶饮利润率能否守住<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48%</span>这个位置。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUWmTDETEM31ASXDJMHG0X0tuuzq5pFnPlkQZ3ADqPW98FRiavYrb6RutH7oGbiahZuG9ibKLqXMc7GT3m01WM68B9TTnOytrhVpE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 包装水增长节奏变化，PET成本直接影响利润</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">包装水业务上半年营收<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">96.41亿元</span>，同比增长仅<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.1%</span>，比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>预期低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.7%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>的解释是，公司已经完全消化了去年疫情后恢复期的高增长基数，增速自然回落到个位数。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">利润端的不确定性更直接。包装水EBIT利润率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35.4%</span>调整至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33.8%</span>，调整167个基点，EBIT同比小幅调整<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.7%</span>。原因很明确：PET树脂价格上涨直接反映在成本端。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>在观察提示中也把“原材料价格变化”列为潜在节奏变化不确定性之一。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里需要区分两个问题。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWS1CIVXzTmaLY0YL7px1pLllYjKDlCXiaVOj9yzVfibNqWfGfYvicicVybqv3tNzkXViaW0LKzPGz80v80JQLicFtEwQoTRm56bmvz0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWf0exzp0mkpnMWTmxaRHkmG5yNXl48J0ENqWcn3qeJxRqcOfiaNCIfE40mOwhACSAwItrlMia2LVSsUGMHBQVaBo3HRUicianIcI8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 06-Bernstein-Nongfu Spring Co Ltd-9633.HK-Nongfu H1- Brewing up a solid beat-260825</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
